#   Ir    — Ir_pv PAW-PBE (includes 5p semi-core; ENMAX ~ 175.587 eV)
#   O     — standard O PAW-PBE  (ENMAX ~ 400.000 eV)
#
# The ENCUT in INCAR (500 eV) exceeds the recommended ENMAX values above,
# providing well-converged plane-wave energies for the IrO2 system.
